{
  "description": [
    "ctadl query model for the TaintBench `backflash` app. Sources and sinks are derived",
    "from the framework methods named in the source/sink IR (Jimple) signatures of",
    "backflash_findings.json. Sources: Intent.getStringExtra() reads the intercepted",
    "phone number the app broadcasts to itself, TelephonyManager.getSimCountryIso() reads",
    "the SIM country, and Context.openFileInput() opens the config file the collected data",
    "was staged in. Sinks: OutputStreamWriter.write() and DataOutputStream.write() write",
    "the data out (to the staging file and to the upload socket), and",
    "HttpURLConnection.getOutputStream() is the C2 upload -- TaintBench marks the",
    "getOutputStream() call itself, whose receiver is the connection built from the tainted",
    "URL, so Argument(*) covers it. The flows this model does not connect all cross an",
    "AsyncTask boundary (`new FlashVirtual().execute(new String[]{...})` reaching",
    "doInBackground(params)), which needs a framework callback bridge rather than a",
    "source/sink model.",
    "ctadl ignores the non-schema `description` key, as it does `expected_lines` in the",
    "nightly models."
  ],
  "model_generators": [
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "getStringExtra",
          "parent": "Landroid/content/Intent;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "IntentData",
            "port": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "getSimCountryIso",
          "parent": "Landroid/telephony/TelephonyManager;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "DeviceData",
            "port": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "openFileInput",
          "parent": "Landroid/content/Context;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "FileData",
            "port": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "write",
          "parent": "Ljava/io/OutputStreamWriter;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sinks": [
          {
            "kind": "Exfiltration",
            "port": "Argument(*)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "write",
          "parent": "Ljava/io/DataOutputStream;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sinks": [
          {
            "kind": "Exfiltration",
            "port": "Argument(*)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "getOutputStream",
          "parent": "Ljava/net/HttpURLConnection;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sinks": [
          {
            "kind": "Exfiltration",
            "port": "Argument(*)"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
